Privacy Policy

Last updated: 2026-07-11

Your privacy is important to us. It is Compass - AR Camera Navigation's policy to respect your privacy regarding any information we may collect from you across our application.

1. Information We Collect
We only ask for personal information when we truly need it to provide a service to you. We collect it by fair and lawful means, with your knowledge and consent.

2. Location Data
Our app requests location access to provide accurate compass headings and weather data. This data is processed locally on your device and is not transmitted to our servers or shared with third parties, except as required by the mapping and weather APIs to fetch local data.

3. Camera Data
Camera access is required for the Augmented Reality (AR) view. The camera feed is processed in real-time on your device and is not recorded, stored, or transmitted.

4. Advertising
We use third-party advertising services (like AdMob) to support the app. These services may collect and use information about your device to provide personalized ads. You can opt-out of personalized ads in your device settings.

5. Third-Party Services
Our app uses third-party services (e.g., Google Maps, Open-Meteo) which may have their own privacy policies. We encourage you to review their policies.

6. Contact Us
If you have any questions about how we handle user data and personal information, feel free to contact us at phoenix.org.support@gmail.com
